  "Description": "Provides a reference to the texture of a [RenderTarget] to implement feedback effects.\n\nConnect the Reference output to the TextureReference input of a [RenderTarget]. The Texture and DepthTexture outputs then provide that render target's textures, which can be used inside the content it renders.\n\nAKA: feedback, reference",
